          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naho niyatanga umwagazi w’intama kw’ikimazi c’icaha, aze atange iyivyara itagira agasembwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aze arambike ikiganza ku mutwe w’ico kimazi hanyuma agikererere aho basanzwe bakererera ibimazi nk’ivyo bitangirwa ivyaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma umuherezi aze yakire igice c’amaraso y’ico kimazi gitangiwe icaha, ayasigishe urutoke ku mahembe y’igicaniro co guturirirako ibimazi, asese ayasigaye hasi i ruhande y’igicaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aze akure ibinure vyose kuri ico kimazi nk’uko ibinure bisanzwe bikurwa ku mwagazi w’intama utanzwe kw’ikimazi c’ishimwe, hanyuma umuherezi abituririre ku gicaniro hejuru y’amashikanwa ashikanirwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Uko ni ko umuherezi azomutangira impongano y’icaha yakoze, na we azoharirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.35"
            ]
          }
